{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55907","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十四 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自从知如觉无明，一衲随缘只麽行。\n被人駡辱无心诤，见说无爲上拟争。\n只合守愚居暗室，又缘缁素要分明。\n爲报往来参学者，得师无意始无生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}